<title>HONG KONG: Hongkong China names new director.</title>
<headline>Hongkong China names new director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hongkong China Ltd, a member of the Lippo Ltd group, said on Thursday it had appointed Zhu Youlan as a director of the company with immediate effect.</p>
<p>Zhu is the vice-chairman and president of China Resources (Holdings) Co Ltd, the parent company of China Resources Enterprise Ltd, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>China Resources Group holds stakes in several Lippo companies, including a 1.56 percent interest in Hongkong China Ltd, 50 percent of the Hongkong Chinese Bank and a 4.1 percent of Lippo Ltd, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
